    <!-- Tutorial -->
    <string name="tutorial_saltar">Skip tutorial</string>
    <string name="tutorial_comecar">Start playing!</string>
    <string name="tutorial_progresso">%1$d / %2$d</string>
    <string name="tutorial_passo1">Get as close to 21 as possible without going over. Whoever is closest at the end of the round wins!</string>
    <string name="tutorial_passo2">The deck has 11 cards numbered 1 to 11. You start with 2 cards — one face up and one face down. Only you know your full hand.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_passo3">On each turn you can draw a card, stay, or play a special card. When both players stay, hands are revealed.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_passo4">Each player starts with 8 lives. Whoever loses the round loses lives equal to the round\'s bet. The bet keeps increasing — watch out!</string>
    <string name="tutorial_passo5">From round 2 onwards you receive special cards. Use them to turn the game in your favour — they change bets, goals, cards in play and much more.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_passo6">The game ends when a player reaches 0 lives. Good luck!</string>

